  m_text: 'To play Clusterbyte, simply select a level and strategically place your
    defenders on the Placeable Terrain blocks. You can start the round and try to
    get the least amount of time to complete each level.


    Note that your lives
    are shared between every level, and tokens are distributed per-level. The goal
    is to get the lowest Cumulative Time as possible! You will have to restart from
    the beginning if you run out of lives!'
